{
  "pid": "self-medium-03",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "title": "闸门电机有限状态机（四状态与安全互锁）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，实现闸门电机的有限状态机，状态为 IDLE / OPENING / CLOSING / FAULT 四种。\n控制要求：\n1. 初始状态为 IDLE，电机输出全部关闭；\n2. IDLE 状态下，openBtn 的上升沿且未开到位（openLimit = FALSE）→ 进入 OPENING；closeBtn 的上升沿且未关到位 → 进入 CLOSING；\n3. OPENING 时 motorUp 为 TRUE；到达 openLimit 后回到 IDLE；\n4. CLOSING 时 motorDown 为 TRUE；到达 closeLimit 后回到 IDLE；\n5. **安全要求**：CLOSING 中检测到 obstacle 时，立即停止下降并反向进入 OPENING；OPENING 中检测到 obstacle 时，立即停机并进入 FAULT；\n6. **motorUp 与 motorDown 在任何时刻都不得同时为 TRUE**；\n7. 障碍消失后不得自动重新动作，必须由操作员重新按按钮；\n8. FAULT 下 errorFlag 置 TRUE 并锁存，直到人工复位（openBtn 与 closeBtn 同时按下）才清除，且 FAULT 期间任何按钮都不得启动电机。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "openBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "开门按钮（上升沿有效）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "closeBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "关门按钮（上升沿有效）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "openLimit",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "开到位限位开关",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "closeLimit",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "关到位限位开关",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "obstacle",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "防夹物体检测",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "motorUp",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "电机上升（开门）输出",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "motorDown",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "电机下降（关门）输出",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "errorFlag",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "故障锁存（需人工复位后清除）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "电机上升与下降输出不得同时为 TRUE。",
      "ltl": "G(!(motorUp & motorDown))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "任何情况下检测到障碍，下降输出必须立即为 FALSE。",
      "ltl": "G(obstacle -> !motorDown)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "开到位后不得再输出上升。",
      "ltl": "G(openLimit -> !motorUp)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "故障锁存后，进入故障的路径必须存在人工复位，且故障期间不得启动电机。",
      "ltl": "G(errorFlag -> !motorUp & !motorDown)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "障碍出现后立即停止是必需的，但**自动恢复**不允许：故障锁存后，障碍解除的那一拍电机不得自动动作。",
      "ltl": "G(errorFlag & X(!obstacle) -> X(!motorUp & !motorDown))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    }
  ],
